{"id":"H0767","lemma":"אֹ֫רֶן","transliteration":"oren","sayIt":"o-ren","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Oren","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.25;\nson of: Jerahmeel (H3396);\nbrother of: Ram (H7410H), Bunah (H0946), Ozem (H0684H), Ahijah (H0281J) and Onam (H0208H)\n§ Oren = \"cedar\"\na descendant of Judah","glosses":["oren"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Oren","kjv":"and Oren"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:25","note":"The sons of Jerahmeel the firstborn of Hezron were Ram the firstborn, Bunah, Oren, Ozem, and Ahijah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0208","lemma":"אוֹנָם","transliteration":"onam","gloss":"Onam"},{"id":"H0281","lemma":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"achiyyah","gloss":"Ahijah"},{"id":"H0684","lemma":"אֹ֫צֶם","transliteration":"otsem","gloss":"Ozem"},{"id":"H3396","lemma":"יְרַחְמְאֵל","transliteration":"yerachmeel","gloss":"Jerahmeel"},{"id":"H7410","lemma":"רָם","transliteration":"ram","gloss":"Ram"},{"id":"H0946","lemma":"בּוּנָה","transliteration":"bunah","gloss":"Bunah"},{"id":"H3397","lemma":"יְרַחְמְאֵלִי","transliteration":"yerachmeeli","gloss":"Jerahmeelite"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}